WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apache License 2.0 section 4(d) requires a NOTICE file to be propagated only when
the upstream work being redistributed ships one. None of the components vendored
into this repository does: there is no NOTICE inside
vendor/libhop-main-54a2e82.xcframework.zip, nor
vendor/hop-mesh-react-native-main-54a2e82.tgz, nor
vendor/hop-android-maven-main-54a2e82.zip (including inside the hop-0.0.5.aar),
nor anywhere under ios/hop-pods/ or vendor/hop-sdk-dev/.

So nothing here is owed under 4(d). This file exists anyway, because the point of
the clause is that attribution should be legible to someone auditing the
repository, and a tree that mixes first-party code with vendored binaries is not
legible without it.

If any vendored component later ships a NOTICE, its text must be reproduced here
verbatim rather than summarised.

